WEBVTT

00:00:01.071 --> 00:00:10.271
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.081 --> 00:00:21.281
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.861 --> 00:00:30.761
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.261 --> 00:00:37.221
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.341 --> 00:00:39.271
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:43.561
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:48.441
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.851 --> 00:00:52.651
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.321 --> 00:01:00.321
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:09.001
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.871 --> 00:01:16.001
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.211 --> 00:01:21.481
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:24.641
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:34.891 --> 00:01:39.461
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:39.931 --> 00:01:43.701
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:43.871 --> 00:01:46.701
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:01:47.971 --> 00:01:49.941
To become Magic Knights...

00:01:50.041 --> 00:01:54.311
...they need weapons created
from escudo, the legendary ore.

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:58.781
However, to get
a hold of those weapons...

00:01:58.881 --> 00:02:02.051
...Hikaru and company
paid a heavy price.

00:02:03.861 --> 00:02:07.851
Hikaru and company
lost Master Smith Presea.

00:02:08.791 --> 00:02:14.731
Ferio in Desperation -
A Romance in the Desert

00:02:37.361 --> 00:02:38.791
Ferio...

00:02:40.161 --> 00:02:44.491
Fuu, that's the gem that Ferio said
would make your wishes come true!

00:02:44.601 --> 00:02:45.431
Yes.

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:47.831
Well? Did you make a wish?

00:02:47.931 --> 00:02:49.201
No, not yet.

00:02:49.301 --> 00:02:52.961
Come on! You have to try
stuff out as soon as you get it!

00:02:53.071 --> 00:02:54.561
I'll try for you!

00:02:54.671 --> 00:02:58.511
Come on, can I?
Can I? Can I? Can I?

00:03:02.751 --> 00:03:05.651
I hope we can
go back to Tokyo soon.

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:09.551
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:03:13.691 --> 00:03:15.721
The fencing tournament can't be...

00:03:15.831 --> 00:03:19.761
...the one being held a week after
the day we arrived in Cephiro?

00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:21.301
Of course!

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:25.131
Umi, it's been over a week
since we came to Cephiro.

00:03:25.741 --> 00:03:29.471
What are you talking about?
Cephiro is a land of the will.

00:03:29.571 --> 00:03:32.631
If I wish it,
even time will pass slower!

00:03:33.481 --> 00:03:36.781
It feels like it really will
happen when Ms. Umi says it.

00:03:36.881 --> 00:03:37.911
Y-Yeah.

00:03:38.681 --> 00:03:41.451
Okay, Hikaru, you make a wish too.

00:03:42.721 --> 00:03:43.691
Okay.

00:03:44.921 --> 00:03:50.621
I want to see Hikari!

00:03:53.101 --> 00:03:56.031
I-I thought my ears would
be blown right off my head!

00:03:56.771 --> 00:03:58.071
S-Sorry.

00:03:58.801 --> 00:04:00.431
But who's Hikari?

00:04:00.541 --> 00:04:02.301
Your brother, Hikaru?

00:04:02.971 --> 00:04:04.811
Hikari is our dog!

00:04:06.411 --> 00:04:08.351
Here, it's your turn, Fuu.

00:04:23.561 --> 00:04:26.361
You mean to tell me
Cephiro is crumbling again?

00:04:26.531 --> 00:04:30.491
This is so irritating!
We're not even Magic Knights yet!

00:04:32.301 --> 00:04:35.971
But before that, we do not know
how to become Magic Knights.

00:04:41.451 --> 00:04:45.881
To become Magic Knights,
you must first revive the Rune-God.

00:04:46.321 --> 00:04:47.441
Clef!

00:04:47.551 --> 00:04:50.081
Clef, I have so much to ask you.

00:04:50.191 --> 00:04:53.121
About the Rune-God too...
But are you all right?

00:04:53.221 --> 00:04:55.251
You were turned to stone...

00:04:55.361 --> 00:04:57.291
Don't worry about me.

00:04:57.401 --> 00:05:01.161
I'm here talking straight
to your hearts, aren't I?

00:05:01.831 --> 00:05:06.241
Instead of worrying about me,
save Cephiro as soon as you can.

00:05:07.971 --> 00:05:10.641
Mokona knows
where the Rune-God is.

00:05:10.741 --> 00:05:12.971
Follow Mokona's directions.

00:05:26.221 --> 00:05:27.211
Clef...

00:05:27.331 --> 00:05:28.351
Ms. Hikaru...

00:05:46.851 --> 00:05:48.071
Let's hurry.

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:49.171
Yeah...

00:05:57.761 --> 00:06:02.961
I hope we can go back to Tokyo soon.
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:06:03.231 --> 00:06:04.701
I want to see Hikari!

00:06:04.701 --> 00:06:05.631
I want to see Hikari!
What's this? Are these
really novice Magic Knights?

00:06:05.631 --> 00:06:08.031
What's this? Are these
really novice Magic Knights?

00:06:09.401 --> 00:06:13.001
What now? I'll be pissed
if it's something stupid again.

00:06:14.341 --> 00:06:15.831
I hope Ferio...

00:06:18.441 --> 00:06:20.841
I hope Ferio is all right.

00:06:23.651 --> 00:06:26.641
M-Man, that was stupid...

00:06:46.401 --> 00:06:49.001
Those Magic Knights are smiling.

00:06:49.441 --> 00:06:51.881
And they killed cute, little Atalante.

00:06:52.241 --> 00:06:53.511
Magic Knights?

00:06:53.611 --> 00:06:56.711
Pajero, you can defeat them easily.

00:06:57.181 --> 00:07:00.021
But how can we lure them out here?

00:07:03.191 --> 00:07:05.161
That's one scary monster.

00:07:05.261 --> 00:07:07.881
Oh, I'm no one to worry about.

00:07:07.991 --> 00:07:10.361
I'm Ferio, a cheap, little bard.

00:07:12.631 --> 00:07:14.891
To be able to control
such monsters...

00:07:15.001 --> 00:07:17.831
Could you be
a summoner under Lord Zagato?

00:07:23.411 --> 00:07:28.241
Please spare me! I'm a boring, little
fellow who looks up to Lord Zagato!

00:07:30.751 --> 00:07:32.651
Hot, hot, hot, hot, hot!

00:07:32.751 --> 00:07:37.591
I'll lure the novice Magic Knights out
here for you. So please spare my life.

00:07:37.691 --> 00:07:40.161
Don't lie. You can't do that.

00:07:41.331 --> 00:07:46.161
Please let me see if I can. Assuming
that I can't, it's still no loss to you.

00:07:46.801 --> 00:07:49.291
Well, if you put it that way.

00:07:49.401 --> 00:07:52.771
If I succeed, I'd like
to meet Lord Zagato...

00:07:53.341 --> 00:07:56.101
You think Zagato would
see someone like you?

00:07:56.211 --> 00:07:58.871
Then allow me to be your apprentice.

00:07:59.081 --> 00:08:00.741
I'll just spare your life.

00:08:00.851 --> 00:08:05.251
Thank you! To be able to become
apprenticed to a summoner like you...

00:08:05.351 --> 00:08:06.541
No!

00:08:06.651 --> 00:08:08.211
I'll go start now.

00:08:10.051 --> 00:08:11.181
Weird guy.

00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:17.691
I wonder if we need passports.

00:08:17.801 --> 00:08:20.131
You have everything, right, Mokona?

00:08:28.971 --> 00:08:30.941
This village looks peaceful.

00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:32.941
Yo!

00:08:33.041 --> 00:08:34.511
We meet again.

00:08:34.611 --> 00:08:35.741
Ferio!

00:08:36.051 --> 00:08:39.881
It's a weird stroke of luck meeting
you guys again. I'll treat you to lunch.

00:08:39.981 --> 00:08:42.111
So you wanna come?

00:08:42.221 --> 00:08:43.651
Sure, I'll go!

00:08:45.221 --> 00:08:47.321
Hey, don't be bashful.

00:08:47.431 --> 00:08:48.551
Yo.

00:08:48.661 --> 00:08:50.131
G-Good day.

00:08:58.501 --> 00:09:02.001
Here you go.
This is our famous pastry.

00:09:02.911 --> 00:09:05.811
Hey, lady, tell them that story.

00:09:06.041 --> 00:09:07.511
Oh, that one?

00:09:07.611 --> 00:09:11.711
One day, a desert popped up
on the other side of the forest.

00:09:12.221 --> 00:09:17.021
They say a hideous monster lives
there, though no one has seen it.

00:09:17.521 --> 00:09:21.291
How do you know it's hideous
if nobody has seen it?

00:09:21.691 --> 00:09:24.821
Because nobody that ventured
that way ever returned.

00:09:27.501 --> 00:09:31.331
Ever since that desert sprouted,
all communication to the town died...

00:09:31.441 --> 00:09:34.561
...and I don't get
any merchandise anymore.

00:09:34.671 --> 00:09:37.111
Anyway, make
yourself at home, okay?

00:09:38.841 --> 00:09:41.611
Are you going to ignore that story?

00:09:42.451 --> 00:09:44.211
Let's go, Umi, Fuu!

00:09:44.321 --> 00:09:47.221
We're going?
We haven't eaten these pastries yet.

00:09:47.591 --> 00:09:50.351
We have to save
people who need help.

00:09:50.891 --> 00:09:53.791
I guess justice
goes ahead of pastries.

00:09:53.891 --> 00:09:55.651
I'll show you the way.

00:09:56.291 --> 00:09:57.631
Thanks, Ferio.

00:09:58.161 --> 00:09:59.561
Don't mention it.

00:10:03.371 --> 00:10:07.361
Here they come...
Memorize their voices well, Pajero.

00:10:18.321 --> 00:10:20.251
This is that desert.

00:10:20.991 --> 00:10:22.611
Mokona, wait here.

00:10:45.981 --> 00:10:46.911
He did it!

00:10:46.911 --> 00:10:48.851
He did it!
I am your apprentice...

00:10:48.951 --> 00:10:50.971
...so this is a piece of cake.

00:10:51.081 --> 00:10:53.051
You're really weird.

00:10:53.691 --> 00:10:55.551
I'm honored by your praise.

00:10:55.651 --> 00:10:59.021
I'm Ascot.
I'll think about your apprenticeship.

00:10:59.121 --> 00:11:01.061
You seem like a fun guy.

00:11:01.161 --> 00:11:02.921
Thank you so much.

00:11:07.931 --> 00:11:11.301
Nothing personal,
but I'll use you to my advantage.

00:11:11.601 --> 00:11:12.931
Don't worry.

00:11:13.041 --> 00:11:15.301
I'll save Princess Emeraude.

00:11:34.961 --> 00:11:39.621
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:41.331 --> 00:11:42.591
Flame...

00:11:52.181 --> 00:11:54.111
It doesn't concern me.

00:12:04.861 --> 00:12:06.321
Fuu! Umi!

00:12:11.401 --> 00:12:12.991
The sandstorm died down.

00:12:13.101 --> 00:12:14.931
That's how Pajero does his thing.

00:12:15.031 --> 00:12:18.161
Well, I'm gonna go watch
the end of the Magic Knights!

00:12:19.971 --> 00:12:21.841
Please wait, Sir Ascot!

00:12:21.941 --> 00:12:23.771
Take me with you please!

00:12:26.981 --> 00:12:29.071
I don't care if you fall.

00:12:34.321 --> 00:12:36.341
That's a great monster!

00:12:36.451 --> 00:12:39.911
But even the strongest monsters
have a weakness or two...

00:12:40.021 --> 00:12:41.361
There aren't any!

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:42.821
Really?

00:12:43.061 --> 00:12:47.591
Well, more specifically,
he can only move in the desert...

00:12:47.701 --> 00:12:50.791
...and he can only chase
after targets using sound.

00:12:51.141 --> 00:12:53.041
Oh, there they are!

00:13:07.591 --> 00:13:08.681
Don't move.

00:13:09.291 --> 00:13:10.251
Ferio?

00:13:10.351 --> 00:13:12.851
That thing responds
to sound. Stay still.

00:13:17.301 --> 00:13:22.431
I hope we can
go back to Tokyo soon.
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:13:26.001 --> 00:13:31.031
I want to see Hikari!

00:13:33.611 --> 00:13:35.551
Pajero, not that way!

00:13:36.151 --> 00:13:37.241
That guy...

00:13:37.351 --> 00:13:39.541
I can't win on the sand!

00:13:39.651 --> 00:13:42.451
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:13:56.771 --> 00:13:57.761
That Ferio...

00:13:57.871 --> 00:13:59.371
I'm sure he had a reason.

00:13:59.371 --> 00:14:01.701
I'm sure he had a reason.
Then why'd he run away?

00:14:01.811 --> 00:14:05.041
Ferio fought out of the
Forest of Silence with us.

00:14:05.141 --> 00:14:07.411
There's no way he'd trick us.

00:14:07.511 --> 00:14:09.611
You think so too, right, Fuu?

00:14:10.411 --> 00:14:11.381
Fuu...

00:14:12.421 --> 00:14:15.321
Ferio's actions seemed
a little too unnatural...

00:14:16.551 --> 00:14:19.991
I have Ferio. I have Ferio.

00:14:20.661 --> 00:14:23.631
If you want to save his life,
come to the desert.

00:14:24.061 --> 00:14:27.721
If you don't come before
tomorrow, I will kill Ferio.

00:14:27.831 --> 00:14:28.971
Let's go save him!

00:14:28.971 --> 00:14:30.261
Let's go save him!
Quit kidding around!

00:14:30.331 --> 00:14:32.001
It may be another trap!

00:14:32.101 --> 00:14:36.101
I don't care! After all, Ferio's
voice saved us a moment ago.

00:14:36.211 --> 00:14:38.201
If you put it that way...

00:14:38.311 --> 00:14:43.651
It may be as you say. But I am not
sure we should leave right away.

00:14:43.851 --> 00:14:44.941
Fuu...

00:14:45.321 --> 00:14:47.881
Unless we find a way
to defeat that monster...

00:14:47.991 --> 00:14:50.581
...going to the desert
is like going to die.

00:14:50.761 --> 00:14:51.741
But Ferio...

00:14:51.861 --> 00:14:55.791
If we die, we cannot
save Ferio or Cephiro.

00:14:56.861 --> 00:14:59.961
We still have time.
Let us think things through.

00:15:07.771 --> 00:15:11.871
I didn't notice this back then
because I was busy running...

00:15:12.641 --> 00:15:15.611
...but why did we hear our voices?

00:15:15.981 --> 00:15:17.351
Hey, Hikaru...

00:15:17.451 --> 00:15:18.421
Hikaru!

00:15:18.781 --> 00:15:19.881
Jeez...

00:15:24.221 --> 00:15:25.451
Ferio...

00:15:26.121 --> 00:15:27.851
Why, Ferio?

00:15:30.191 --> 00:15:31.321
Ferio...

00:15:32.661 --> 00:15:33.721
No...

00:15:33.831 --> 00:15:35.701
Don't, Fuu, don't!

00:15:35.801 --> 00:15:37.561
What? What happened?

00:15:39.001 --> 00:15:40.991
No, don't, Fuu...

00:15:42.141 --> 00:15:43.771
Oh, Hikaru...

00:15:44.011 --> 00:15:47.571
And Fuu too.
Not waking up to such a loud...

00:15:51.551 --> 00:15:53.071
Serves you right.

00:15:53.181 --> 00:15:56.641
Using me as bait for
the Magic Knights is a bit much...

00:15:56.751 --> 00:15:58.691
I don't think they'll come.

00:15:58.991 --> 00:16:00.981
Then why did you save them?

00:16:01.091 --> 00:16:05.691
It was all on a whim. I was only
testing Pajero's powers. Forgive me!

00:16:05.801 --> 00:16:07.821
Ferio, look! They're here!

00:16:08.671 --> 00:16:11.291
So, Pajero, take care of the rest.

00:16:11.401 --> 00:16:12.491
Please wait!

00:16:17.211 --> 00:16:18.301
Man...

00:16:20.111 --> 00:16:21.871
Fuu, don't come here!

00:16:22.051 --> 00:16:23.451
Run, Fuu!

00:16:24.481 --> 00:16:25.681
Emerald...

00:16:44.041 --> 00:16:45.001
Fuu!

00:16:59.681 --> 00:17:01.621
Fuu! Fuu!

00:17:02.391 --> 00:17:03.351
Fuu!

00:17:04.261 --> 00:17:05.781
Fuu! Fuu!

00:17:06.121 --> 00:17:07.111
Fuu!

00:17:11.201 --> 00:17:13.721
Why'd you come? I tricked you!

00:17:14.071 --> 00:17:16.061
I do not know myself.

00:17:16.171 --> 00:17:19.731
I was very sad when
I thought you had tricked me.

00:17:19.841 --> 00:17:23.201
I thought I could
not forgive you. But I came here.

00:17:23.311 --> 00:17:25.331
I really wonder why.

00:17:25.481 --> 00:17:28.001
Man, you're such an idiot.

00:17:29.551 --> 00:17:32.981
This is the first time I have
ever been called an idiot.

00:17:36.151 --> 00:17:39.751
Shoot, it was getting good...
What a rude monster.

00:17:40.461 --> 00:17:43.691
Fuu, do you have the orb?
The thing I gave you?

00:17:48.471 --> 00:17:49.971
I hope we can go back to Tokyo soon.

00:17:49.971 --> 00:17:51.461
I hope we can go back to Tokyo soon.
Ferio, this...

00:17:51.571 --> 00:17:52.761
Don't speak.

00:17:52.871 --> 00:17:56.101
I'll distract that thing. While I do, run!

00:17:59.781 --> 00:18:00.741
Ferio!

00:18:00.851 --> 00:18:02.111
Keep quiet!

00:18:04.581 --> 00:18:09.681
I hope we can go back to Tokyo soon.
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:18:11.761 --> 00:18:16.821
I want to see Hikari!

00:18:20.871 --> 00:18:26.061
I hope we can go back to Tokyo soon.
I hope I win that fencing tournament!

00:18:26.841 --> 00:18:28.361
I hope Ferio...

00:18:28.741 --> 00:18:31.001
I hope Ferio is all right.

00:18:35.781 --> 00:18:39.341
Ferio!

00:19:13.081 --> 00:19:14.351
The sword...

00:19:15.491 --> 00:19:16.921
The sword evolved?

00:19:22.031 --> 00:19:23.861
This weapon can...

00:19:24.761 --> 00:19:26.531
I am over here!

00:19:27.231 --> 00:19:28.991
Don't go! Over here!

00:20:27.461 --> 00:20:29.791
It was good that
the weapon evolved...

00:20:30.531 --> 00:20:32.791
...but something's wrong with you.

00:20:33.431 --> 00:20:36.061
No, something is wrong with you.

00:20:36.171 --> 00:20:38.691
To trick us, then save us...

00:20:39.201 --> 00:20:40.171
Fuu!

00:20:41.111 --> 00:20:42.001
Fuu!

00:20:42.611 --> 00:20:44.541
The arrival of the teammates.

00:20:45.281 --> 00:20:46.711
Here you go.

00:20:47.041 --> 00:20:48.881
You know what it is, right?

00:20:48.981 --> 00:20:51.781
It is not a gem that
grants my wishes, right?

00:20:51.881 --> 00:20:54.651
It's a magic item. It sends words.

00:20:55.351 --> 00:20:57.951
If you ever need me,
call me anytime.

00:20:59.791 --> 00:21:00.961
If I feel like it.

00:21:00.961 --> 00:21:03.091
If I feel like it.
Man, you're so dull.

00:21:03.191 --> 00:21:04.391
Fuu!

00:21:04.901 --> 00:21:07.691
Hikaru I can handle,
but I can't stand Umi. See ya.

00:21:16.271 --> 00:21:17.301
Fuu!

00:21:18.011 --> 00:21:19.101
Ms. Hikaru.

00:21:19.211 --> 00:21:21.181
Fuu, where is he?

00:21:21.281 --> 00:21:22.471
He left already.

00:21:22.581 --> 00:21:23.601
What?

00:21:23.711 --> 00:21:27.881
In any case, Fuu, it was reckless
to come out here all by yourself!

00:21:27.991 --> 00:21:29.821
F-Fuu's sword...

00:21:31.091 --> 00:21:33.111
It seems that it evolved.

00:21:33.221 --> 00:21:36.221
Why'd her weapon evolve
after a reckless act?

00:21:36.331 --> 00:21:38.891
I'm not satisfied
with this! It's so unfair!

00:21:39.001 --> 00:21:40.961
If it grows due to recklessness...

00:21:41.071 --> 00:21:45.531
...all the kamikaze car drivers out
there would become Magic Knights!

00:21:45.671 --> 00:21:49.611
I can't believe this!
Really, I can't take this anymore!

00:21:54.351 --> 00:21:55.541
Pajero...

00:21:55.651 --> 00:21:58.951
How dare they do such
cruel things to my friends...

00:21:59.051 --> 00:22:02.211
You'll pay for this, Magic Knights...

00:22:02.751 --> 00:22:06.381
Magic Knights!

00:22:26.811 --> 00:22:31.211
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.781 --> 00:22:38.381
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.821 --> 00:22:45.391
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.131 --> 00:22:49.961
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.271 --> 00:22:55.431
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.641 --> 00:22:58.071
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.181 --> 00:23:02.981
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:04.011 --> 00:23:10.651
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.391 --> 00:23:16.661
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.031 --> 00:23:23.831
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.331 --> 00:23:29.771
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:46.661 --> 00:23:48.781
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!

00:23:48.891 --> 00:23:52.691
Hikaru saw a little animal
wounded by a monster and saved it.

00:23:52.801 --> 00:23:55.291
I told her I didn't
want it along with us.

00:23:55.401 --> 00:23:59.841
But Hikaru is so kind.
She even named it Hikari.

00:23:59.941 --> 00:24:04.271
But that Hikari suddenly
grew large and attacked Hikaru.

00:24:04.811 --> 00:24:06.781
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:06.911 --> 00:24:09.311
The Horrible Trap of Summoner Ascot.

00:24:09.411 --> 00:24:09.851
The Horrible Trap of Summoner Ascot

00:24:09.851 --> 00:24:11.821
The Horrible Trap of Summoner Ascot
You have to watch it!

00:24:11.821 --> 00:24:13.421
The Horrible Trap of Summoner Ascot

00:24:13.421 --> 00:24:20.351
Who is it today?

00:24:21.431 --> 00:24:23.331
Today, it's Hikaru!

00:24:23.431 --> 00:24:23.991
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.991 --> 00:24:26.861
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.861 --> 00:24:29.391
Look forward to the next episode!
See you later!
